        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-645.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-645-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH646-DT-ASSM-TK-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH647-PART-READ-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH648-DT-TK-LAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH649-650M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
